[Substrike]
format=1
name=Comb Hollow
category=Hardstyle
author=Substrike
tags=hardstyle, comb, hollow
description=Euphoric Notch with the single cut replaced by a Comb on every even harmonic: twelve narrow cuts that fade out towards the top, for a hollow, square tail. The comb follows the keys; root C2, tail on F1.
